{"id":"delante","lemma":"delante","pos":"adv","rank":642,"glosses":["in front of, before (spatially)","forward, forwards (with hacia preceding it)","ahead (with por preceding it)"],"ipa":"/deˈlante/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/03/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-delante.wav","examples":[{"text":"Veámonos delante del teatro.","en":"Let's meet in front of the theater.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/512838"},{"text":"No llores delante de todos.","en":"Don't cry in public.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/630502"},{"text":"Nadie corrió delante de él.","en":"No one ran ahead of him.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582318"},{"text":"¿Qué ha pasado ahí delante?","en":"What's happened up ahead?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/422351"},{"text":"¿Qué puedes ver allí delante?","en":"What can you see up ahead?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/300056"}]}